{
  "nodes": [
    {"id":"p0-title","type":"text","text":"# Phase 0 simulation roadmap\nOne auditable basketball simulator, advanced only by measured evidence.","x":-650,"y":-750,"width":1400,"height":140,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"p0-a","type":"text","text":"## 0A ✅ ENGINE\nDeterministic resolver\n• legal actions\n• decision tape\n• exact replay","x":-650,"y":-540,"width":420,"height":210,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-b","type":"text","text":"## 0B ✅ CALIBRATION\n1,000 seeded games\n• team + player metrics\n• realism guardrails\n• rebound correction","x":-180,"y":-540,"width":420,"height":210,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-c","type":"text","text":"## 0C ✅ AI GUARDRAIL\nLegal actions only\n• strict validation\n• deterministic fallback\n• recorded replay","x":290,"y":-540,"width":420,"height":210,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-d","type":"text","text":"## 0D + 0D.1 ✅ LEAGUE\nSchedule + standings\n• three saved seasons\n• carryover fatigue\n• exact save/resume","x":290,"y":-250,"width":420,"height":210,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-d2","type":"text","text":"## 0D.2 ✅ ROTATIONS\nSix-player rosters\n• deterministic lineups\n• authoritative minutes\n• workload from minutes","x":-180,"y":-250,"width":420,"height":210,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-d3","type":"text","text":"## 0D.3 ✅ AVAILABILITY\nMinor injuries + recovery\n• minutes-linked risk\n• five-player floor\n• exact save/replay","x":-650,"y":-250,"width":420,"height":210,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-evidence-b","type":"text","text":"## 📊 Calibration evidence\n[[Development/Reports/Phase 0B Baseline|Phase 0B report]]\n1,000 games • 9/9 checks","x":-650,"y":40,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5"},
    {"id":"p0-evidence-c","type":"text","text":"## 🛡️ AI evidence\n[[Development/Reports/Phase 0C Offline LLM Policy Pilot|Phase 0C report]]\n8,140 decisions • fairness • $0","x":-180,"y":40,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"p0-evidence-d","type":"text","text":"## 🩹 Availability evidence\n[[Development/Reports/Phase 0D3 Availability and Recovery|Phase 0D.3 report]]\n1.43% injuries • 20/20 absences at 0 minutes • $0","x":290,"y":40,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-playable","type":"text","text":"## 0D.4 ✅ PUBLIC PREDICTIONS\n15 warm-up + 5 locked holdout seasons\n• 100/100 commitments verified\n• best Brier 0.2416 vs 0.2500\n• $0 and no wagering","x":-650,"y":280,"width":650,"height":190,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-life","type":"text","text":"## 🧍 ATHLETE LIFE BRAIN: ACTIVE PILOT\nTrain • rest • recover • socialize\nBounded temporary consequences now precede narrative and long-term systems.","x":60,"y":280,"width":650,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-next","type":"text","text":"## 0.5A ✅ GAME THEATER\nReal seeded game → recorded visual replay\n• lineups • plays • clock • score • ball motion\nSymbolic positions are clearly labeled.","x":-650,"y":530,"width":650,"height":170,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5b","type":"text","text":"## 0.5B ✅ LEAGUE VIEWER\nTeams • athletes • schedule • standings\nAvailability • commitments • per-game inspection\n20 verified results • $0 • read only","x":60,"y":530,"width":650,"height":170,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5c","type":"text","text":"## 0.5C ✅ ARCHIVED GAME PLAYBACK\nSelect result → full recorded Game Theater replay\nScore + minutes verified • hidden state server-side • $0","x":-650,"y":760,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5d","type":"text","text":"## 0.5D ✅ ATHLETE CAREER PROFILES\n12 durable profiles • specialties • availability\nSeason metrics • five-game form • 20-game history • replay links • $0","x":-650,"y":970,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5e","type":"text","text":"## 0.5E ✅ CAREER PERSISTENCE\n12 stable careers • 3 verified seasons • 60 games\nCumulative totals • season selector • cross-season replays • 12 active / 0 retired • $0","x":-650,"y":1180,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5f","type":"text","text":"## 0.5F ✅ CAREER LIFECYCLE RULES\nExplicit ages • bounded growth + decline • specialties preserved\nAge-35 retirement • 11 active / 1 retired • authoritative ratings + replays • $0","x":-650,"y":1390,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5g","type":"text","text":"## 0.5G ✅ ROSTER CONTINUITY\nRoman history preserved • Soren Lake enters Season 4\n6 athletes per team • 13 profiles • 12 active / 1 retired • exact replays • $0","x":-650,"y":1600,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5h","type":"text","text":"## 0.5H ✅ ATHLETE LIFE BRAIN v1\n912 auditable train • rest • recover • socialize choices\nTemporary next-game effects • durable ratings unchanged • exact save + replay • $0","x":-650,"y":1810,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5i","type":"text","text":"## 0.5I ✅ LIFE BRAIN EVALUATION\n912/912 choices • 80/80 games reconstructed • 0 policy violations\nBounded influence measured • no gameplay or policy change • $0","x":-650,"y":2020,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5j","type":"text","text":"## 0.5J ✅ LIFE PREFERENCE REVIEW\nFuture practice | social input defined • v1 history stays immutable\nDesign only • no runtime, schema, archive, or outcome change • $0","x":-650,"y":2230,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5k","type":"text","text":"## 0.5K ✅ VERSIONED PREFERENCE PILOT\nOpt-in v2 • 912 fresh choices • exact preference adherence\nDefault v1 + history unchanged • same state schema • $0","x":-650,"y":2440,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5l","type":"text","text":"## 0.5L ✅ MULTI-SEED EVALUATION\n800 games + 9,120 decisions per policy • 10 untouched seed blocks\nAll stability alarms pass • v2 eligible, not promoted • $0","x":-650,"y":2650,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5m","type":"text","text":"## 0.5M ✅ V2 PROMOTION REVIEW\nApproved for controlled promotion • default remains v1 during review\nHistorical evidence must be pinned before rollout • $0","x":-650,"y":2860,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5n","type":"text","text":"## 0.5N ✅ CONTROLLED V2 ROLLOUT\nV2 default for new league/Admin decisions • frozen studies pinned to v1\nOld replays preserved • stored-version display • one-constant rollback • $0","x":-650,"y":3070,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"p0-5o","type":"text","text":"## NEXT: 0.5O MEMORY CONTRACT REVIEW\nDefine one bounded short-term memory input before implementation\nAuditable state • expiry • consequence • history contract • evaluation gate","x":-650,"y":3280,"width":1360,"height":150,"color":"4"}
